DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
2336::$$$message_0014_0000_0000$$$::I leave the shed.[lr]::
2337::$$$message_0014_0000_0001$$$::I did everything I meant to do in there, so now to go back to my room...[lr]::
2338::$$$message_0014_0000_0002$$$::"...Oh."[lr]::
2339::$$$message_0014_0000_0003$$$::Rider's in the yard.[lr]::
2340::$$$message_0014_0000_0004$$$::At first I think she's on the way out, but she's acting a little strange.::
2341::$$$message_0014_0001_0000$$$::...What's Rider up to?[lr]::
2342::$$$message_0014_0001_0001$$$::I climb the scaffold and watch her from the skylight.::
2343::$$$message_0014_0002_0000$$$::She seems to be concerned with the house, but it also looks like she doesn't want to be seen.[movefg opacity=0 time=600 pos=rc accel=2 storage=ライダー私服01e(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=600 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=ライダー私服04b(遠) textoff=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
2344::$$$message_0014_0003_0000$$$::It's unusual to see Rider acting this suspiciously.[lr]::
2345::$$$message_0014_0003_0001$$$::Is she sneaking out to go shopping...?[lr]::
2346::$$$message_0014_0003_0002$$$::I could imagine Sakura or Saber doing that, but why would Rider be this cautious about leaving the house...?::
2347::$$$message_0014_0004_0000$$$::"...No. She isn't trying to leave."[lr]::
2348::$$$message_0014_0004_0001$$$::If Rider wanted to sneak out, she could just jump up on the roof.[lr]::
2349::$$$message_0014_0004_0002$$$::Only Saber would be able to follow her then, and nobody else would even notice.[lr]::
2350::$$$message_0014_0004_0003$$$::Meaning that her goal is inside, not outside...::
2351::$$$message_0014_0005_0000$$$::"...I see."[lr]::
2352::$$$message_0014_0005_0001$$$::Rider has certain interests.[lr]::
2353::$$$message_0014_0005_0002$$$::I know for a fact that one of them is in the bicycle parking area.::
2354::$$$message_0014_0006_0000$$$::"Honestly, Rider..."[lr]::
2355::$$$message_0014_0006_0001$$$::I leave the shed and hurry over to the gate.::
2356::$$$message_0014_0007_0000$$$::"Hey, Rider!"[lr]::
2357::$$$message_0014_0007_0001$$$::I get her attention.[lr]::
2358::$$$message_0014_0007_0002$$$::As expected, Rider is examining Bicycle No.1...my favorite bike.::
2359::$$$message_0014_0008_0000$$$::"Sh-Shirou? Are you leaving?"[lr]::
2360::$$$message_0014_0008_0001$$$::"No, I just came out of the shed. What about you? If you're going shopping, Bike No.2 is over there."[lr]::
2361::$$$message_0014_0008_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
2362::$$$message_0014_0008_0003$$$::No.2 is used for shopping. It's what you'd call a granny bike with a front basket.[lr]::
2363::$$$message_0014_0008_0004$$$::And the flat-handled hybrid bike is No.1.::
2364::$$$message_0014_0009_0000$$$::"...There's an explanation for this, Shirou."[lr]::
2365::$$$message_0014_0009_0001$$$::"Okay, let's hear it."[lr]::
2366::$$$message_0014_0009_0002$$$::"Yes. I'll only tell you.[lr]::
2367::$$$message_0014_0009_0003$$$::I've never even said this to Sakura before, [wvl canskip=0 time=500]but despite appearances, I actually prefer faster vehicles."[lr]::
2368::$$$message_0014_0009_0004$$$::"Uh, I know that."[lr]::
2369::$$$message_0014_0009_0005$$$::Was that supposed to be a secret?::
2370::$$$message_0014_0010_0000$$$::"...Let me finish.[lr]::
2371::$$$message_0014_0010_0001$$$::I'm impressed by your perceptiveness, but you still don't know why I'm here."[lr]::
2372::$$$message_0014_0010_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
2373::$$$message_0014_0010_0003$$$::I think the reason couldn't be clearer, but I keep my mouth shut.[lr]::
2374::$$$message_0014_0010_0004$$$::As Rider says, I should let her finish speaking.::
2375::$$$message_0014_0011_0000$$$::"Listen.[lr]::
2376::$$$message_0014_0011_0001$$$::It's true that No.2 has cargo space and is low maintenance. For light outings or shopping, it is an ideal vehicle."::
2377::$$$message_0014_0012_0000$$$::"But...a vehicle that doesn't go any faster no matter how hard I pedal doesn't fit my tastes.[lr]::
2378::$$$message_0014_0012_0001$$$::No, this isn't just about my personal preferences. I feel that I would break it if I pedaled any harder, so I question its value as a vehicle. A vehicle should give you just as much speed as the energy you put into it.[lr]::
2379::$$$message_0014_0012_0002$$$::What I'm saying is, it's unclear if No.2's speed abides by the law of conservation of energy."::
2380::$$$message_0014_0013_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
2381::$$$message_0014_0013_0001$$$::Um. That's how the laws of physics are supposed to work.[lr]::
2382::$$$message_0014_0013_0002$$$::If you pedal a hundred kilometers per hour on a bike that can only go twenty kilometers per hour, then yeah, of course it's going to break.::
2383::$$$message_0014_0014_0000$$$::"Unlike No.2, No.1 is designed to travel at higher speeds.[lr]::
2384::$$$message_0014_0014_0001$$$::I think all of my concerns would be addressed if I had such vehicle.[lr]::
2385::$$$message_0014_0014_0002$$$::It would improve my energy management."[lr]::
2386::$$$message_0014_0014_0003$$$::...And now I have no idea what she's thinking.::
2387::$$$message_0014_0015_0000$$$::"...Phew. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ライダー私服01b(中)]What do you think, Shirou?[lr]::
2388::$$$message_0014_0015_0001$$$::I'm sure you more or less understand what my desire is."[lr]::
2389::$$$message_0014_0015_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
2390::$$$message_0014_0015_0003$$$::Sorry, I don't have a clue. But I still know what my answer is.::
2391::$$$message_0014_0016_0000$$$::"Um...sorry, but no."[lr]::
2392::$$$message_0014_0016_0001$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ライダー私服04g(中)][say storage=emi0137_rad_0090 name=ライダー]You answered that so quickly, I don't sense any sympathy from you."[lr]::
2393::$$$message_0014_0016_0002$$$::Of course not.[lr]::
2394::$$$message_0014_0016_0003$$$::I will not let a neighborhood menace like that come out of our garage.::
2395::$$$message_0014_0017_0000$$$::"...Do you intend to make me keep riding No.2 and subject me to spot balding as a result of low-speed stress?"[lr]::
2396::$$$message_0014_0017_0001$$$::"...Is that even a thing? Well, I wouldn't want that, and it would make Sakura sad, but my answer is still no."::
2397::$$$message_0014_0018_0000$$$::I'm not only worried about being responsible for creating a neighborhood menace.[lr]::
2398::$$$message_0014_0018_0001$$$::If I give her a foothold now, it could upset the delicate balance of power in this household.[lr]::
2399::$$$message_0014_0018_0002$$$::In other words, I can see the walls closing in on me.::
2400::$$$message_0014_0019_0000$$$::"Shirou.[lr]::
2401::$$$message_0014_0019_0001$$$::If you won't let me use No.1, then I will have to resort to more forceful measures."[lr]::
2402::$$$message_0014_0019_0002$$$::"...Oof. Are you going to rob me of my favorite Bianchi by force?"::
2403::$$$message_0014_0020_0000$$$::"No, that would be a final resort. I'm not Saber."[lr]::
2404::$$$message_0014_0020_0001$$$::Rider casually lets slip what she really thinks of Saber.::
2405::$$$message_0014_0021_0000$$$::"Shirou, Bicycle No.1 is not the only superior vehicle in the world.[lr]::
2406::$$$message_0014_0021_0001$$$::You don't have to lend me No.1. I will instead seek out a swifter steed.[lr]::
2407::$$$message_0014_0021_0002$$$::I'll begin by borrowing Taiga's scooter, and then move on to the Fujimura Group's large motorcycle."::
2408::$$$message_0014_0022_0000$$$::"...Gah."[lr]::
2409::$$$message_0014_0022_0001$$$::If she's going for revenge, that's the jackpot.[lr]::
2410::$$$message_0014_0022_0002$$$::She can only be referring to the big dragster I've worked on for Raiga. It's so heavy that I can't pick it up on my own if it falls over.::
2411::$$$message_0014_0023_0000$$$::"Are you fine with that, Shirou?"[lr]::
2412::$$$message_0014_0023_0001$$$::"...Does it matter?[lr]::
2413::$$$message_0014_0023_0002$$$::Do you even have a motorcycle license, Rider?"[lr]::
2414::$$$message_0014_0023_0003$$$::If she's driving in public roads, she has to strictly follow the law.[lr]::
2415::$$$message_0014_0023_0004$$$::No one can stop her from riding the Pegasus, but she has to abide by society's rules on a motorcycle.::
2416::$$$message_0014_0024_0000$$$::"...A driver's license has no correlation to driving skill."[lr]::
2417::$$$message_0014_0024_0001$$$::"Then, no. If you want to drive a motorcycle, then you're going to take lessons and get a license.[lr]::
2418::$$$message_0014_0024_0002$$$::Besides, we'll be in deep trouble if the police catch you driving without a license. Sakura would weep."[lr]::
2419::$$$message_0014_0024_0003$$$::"Ah..."[lr]::
2420::$$$message_0014_0024_0004$$$::Bringing up Sakura is super effective![lr]::
2421::$$$message_0014_0024_0005$$$::...Granted, I can't even imagine the police arresting Rider.::
2422::$$$message_0014_0025_0000$$$::Rider looks disappointed.[lr]::
2423::$$$message_0014_0025_0001$$$::...I think she's given up on the idea.[lr]::
2424::$$$message_0014_0025_0002$$$::No.1 might be off-limits, but I could make some time to build a No.4 for Rider that's more capable than the granny bike...::
2425::$$$message_0014_0026_0000$$$::"...Shirou..."[lr]::
2426::$$$message_0014_0026_0001$$$::She unexpectedly whispers in my ear.[lr]::
2427::$$$message_0014_0026_0002$$$::Rider approaches me [se storage=se028 nowait=true]and places her cool hand on my neck...::
2428::$$$message_0014_0027_0000$$$::"Then let us do things as you humans do: equivalent exchange."[lr]::
2429::$$$message_0014_0027_0001$$$::"Uh..."[lr]::
2430::$$$message_0014_0027_0002$$$::"If you allow me to use No.1...I'll make sure to show my gratitude... Hehe."::
2431::$$$message_0014_0028_0000$$$::Her fingers caress my jaw.[wshock canskip=0][lr]::
2432::$$$message_0014_0028_0001$$$::Her lips seem about to nip at my earlobe, and her voice is unbelievably sweet.::
2433::$$$message_0014_0029_0000$$$::"G-g-gratitude!?"[lr]::
2434::$$$message_0014_0029_0001$$$::"You can do whatever you want...to me.[lr]::
2435::$$$message_0014_0029_0002$$$::[chgfg bluroff=1 storage=ライダー私服01d(近)b time=300 textoff=0]What do you want to do to me, Shirou...and where do you want to do it...?"::
2436::$$$message_0014_0030_0000$$$::Her words echo like a magic spell in my head.[lr]::
2437::$$$message_0014_0030_0001$$$::What I want from Rider.[lr]::
2438::$$$message_0014_0030_0002$$$::I can do...anything...[lr]::
2439::$$$message_0014_0030_0003$$$::[chgfg bluroff=1 time=600 storage=ライダー私服01c(近) textoff=0]...Did she just hit me with some kind of magical charm?[lr]::
2440::$$$message_0014_0030_0004$$$::My body feels boiling hot, [seloop time=500 storage=se028 nowait=true]but Rider's body that she's pressing against me feels as cool as an underground spring.[lr]::
2441::$$$message_0014_0030_0005$$$::I'm so dizzy and everything is in such a haze that I think I'm about to say something absurd.::
2442::$$$message_0014_0031_0000$$$::"Rider, you mean..."[lr]::
2443::$$$message_0014_0031_0001$$$::"We can do [font italic=true]anything[font italic=false]. Just you. And me. Hehe."[lr]::
2444::$$$message_0014_0031_0002$$$::She strokes my cheek.[lr]::
2445::$$$message_0014_0031_0003$$$::Rider turns my face toward hers, and her irresistible, captivating eyes bore into me.::
2446::$$$message_0014_0032_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
2447::$$$message_0014_0032_0001$$$::Huh...?[lr]::
2448::$$$message_0014_0032_0002$$$::That's weird. I think Sakura's watching us.::
2449::$$$message_0014_0033_0000$$$::"...Though,[lr]::
2450::$$$message_0014_0033_0001$$$::I meant that as a joke, of course."::
2451::$$$message_0014_0034_0000$$$::Rider slips away from me as easily as a snake out of one's hands. Then, she quickly [chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服08e(遠) textoff=0]assumes a cool expression, as if nothing even happened.::
2452::$$$message_0014_0035_0000$$$::"R-[large]R[rf]i[line len=2][wvl][large][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=-12]RIDER![rf]"::
2453::$$$message_0014_0036_0000$$$::"I'll be heading out now. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=ライダー私服01a(中) textoff=0]The two of you enjoy yourselves."[lr]::
2454::$$$message_0014_0036_0001$$$::"Urgh, no, Sakura, nothing happened just now!"[lr]::
2455::$$$message_0014_0036_0002$$$::"Senpai... [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01a(中)][wvl][movefg opacity=255 left=884 top=2 time=600 accel=2 storage=ライダー私服01a(中) textoff=0]What did you try to do, Senpai!?"[wm canskip=0]::
2456::$$$message_0014_0037_0000$$$::She heard it all!!![lr]::
2457::$$$message_0014_0037_0001$$$::"Wait. It's not like that. It's not like that at all! Rider!"[lr]::
2458::$$$message_0014_0037_0002$$$::She's so quick to switch gears.[lr]::
2459::$$$message_0014_0037_0003$$$::Rider kicks No.2 into motion and speeds off to Miyama.::
2460::$$$message_0014_0038_0000$$$::"Argh, dang it! It's not like that! I didn't do anything to Rider that I want to do with you, Sakura!"[lr]::
2461::$$$message_0014_0038_0001$$$::"Then what do you want to do with me... [cacheimage storage=桜私服08k(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服08k(中) textoff=0]I can't believe you, Senpai..."::
2462::$$$message_0014_0039_0000$$$::"It's not like that! No! I mean, maybe!?[lr]::
2463::$$$message_0014_0039_0001$$$::It was nothing, really! Rider wanted to take No.1!"[lr]::
2464::$$$message_0014_0039_0002$$$::"Yes...I see how it is. You already have a number two..."[lr]::
2465::$$$message_0014_0039_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服02d涙(中) textoff=0]That's a bizarre misunderstanding...[lr]::
2466::$$$message_0014_0039_0004$$$::Argh, Rider... She'd better explain this to Sakura later.::
902344::$$$message_9014_0003_0000$$$::It's unusual to see Rider acting this suspiciously.[r]:�޵